# Template for local, machine-only secrets.
#
#   cp .env.example .env && chmod 600 .env
#
# `.env` is git-ignored and never applied by chezmoi — it stays on this machine.
# Load it into the current shell with:
#
#   set -a; . ./.env; set +a
#
# Use this only for throwaway/local tokens. Anything needed on every machine
# belongs in an `encrypted_*.age` file, and GitHub tokens are best left to
# `gh auth login`.

# GH_TOKEN=
# NTFY_TOPIC=
